    "faq_4JhpGN": {
      "type": "faq",
      "blocks": {
        "frequently_asked_question_EP64mk": {
          "type": "frequently_asked_question",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "heart",
            "another_icon": "",
            "custom_icon": "",
            "heading": "What to Expect From AIWO Sculpting?",
            "row_content": "<p>The process is completely painless! Specialized paddles are applied over your target area, delivering advanced muscle stimulation that mimics intense muscle contractions. These deep contractions engage and strengthen your core muscles effectively. After the session, gentle tapping helps promote relaxation and comfort. AiwoSculpt is especially beneficial for strengthening core muscles, making it an excellent option for individuals looking to improve abdominal tone, including mothers seeking to restore core strength post-childbirth.</p>"
          }
        },
        "frequently_asked_question_mK4jQW": {
          "type": "frequently_asked_question",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "heart",
            "another_icon": "",
            "custom_icon": "",
            "heading": "What to Expect at Your AiwoSculpt Appointment?",
            "row_content": "<p>If AiwoSculpt aligns with your fitness goals, it’s helpful to understand the procedure. Each 30-minute session involves AiwoSculpt paddles applied directly to your target area, either on bare skin or thin clothing of your choice. The session includes different phases of advanced muscle stimulation, designed to engage muscles at varying intensities. While the sensation may feel unique—like an intense workout without movement—your technician will gradually adjust the intensity to your comfort level. You may experience gripping, tightening, or gentle tingling as your muscles are activated.</p>"
          }
        },
        "frequently_asked_question_6d9PWy": {
          "type": "frequently_asked_question",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "heart",
            "another_icon": "",
            "custom_icon": "",
            "heading": "How Many Sessions Are Required?",
            "row_content": "<p>A course comprises 20 sessions, with effects lasting up to 6 months with proper maintenance. Additional sessions may be needed for optimal results.<br/>Improve muscle tone, gain strength, and aid in rehabilitation with AiwoSculpt.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
